OL,3,AHundreds of migrants enter UK after
OL,4,A10-day lull
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 500 migrants have arrived in the
OL,7,FUK in one day, in the first boats to
OL,8,Fsuccessfully cross the Channel in 10
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FThe seven vessels that made the
OL,12,Fcrossing were the first since 17 August
OL,13,Fwhen 250 people arrived.
OL,15,FDinghies arrived in British waters
OL,16,Funtil late into the night on Thursday,
OL,17,Fwith 494 people being brought into the
OL,18,FBorder Security Command compound in
OL,19,FDover, Kent.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
